WEBVTT

00:04:28.428 --> 00:04:31.968
is deeply corrosive to religious faith.

00:04:33.349 --> 00:04:38.572
Now, it may sound as though
I'm about to preach atheism,

00:04:38.596 --> 00:04:42.428
and I want to reassure you
that that's not what I'm going to do.

00:04:42.452 --> 00:04:45.976
In an audience
as sophisticated as this one,

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.353
that would be preaching to the choir.

00:04:48.853 --> 00:04:51.473
No, what I want to urge upon you --

00:04:51.497 --> 00:04:55.240
(Laughter)

00:04:55.264 --> 00:04:59.976
Instead, what I want to urge
upon you is militant atheism.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.976
(Laughter)